  "content": "<center>\n<h1><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/125e225c230845b5c04ce12b6a1efc9479dc2ceb.png\" alt=\"Allure 微縮材質包\"></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-3d-plants/\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a2dd1324a19f7594a6e032659b78fb3e5e89a2d.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/allure-6439754/\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/48f3ed3f11e619ef7fea93c4344ae8f4ba233cb0.png\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/p4ncake\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1fab8f2e1518ab9f6373586085d9aa785e0e3b9d.png\" alt=\"在 Ko-Fi 上支持我\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/C9Q6XFG8T8\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f5a8b8552da877af71a331499e3fffcb57b513a.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord 社群！\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Allure 3D 植物</strong> 是名為 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-pack/\">Allure</a> 的大型專案的一部分。這個材質包包含了以 Allure 風格設計的 3D 植物，並且與 Allure 一同發展。此材質包的目標是在不過度修改模型的情況下，讓植物看起來更美觀。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/VhLFOwiA/images/d0d575ebac018eb634d3ed6f7197e03d5bf5f9fd.jpeg\" alt=\"花朵截圖\"><hr><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/VhLFOwiA/images/84e4d34a8a43be3998420a9516be70f5cce9f0c8.png\"></p>  \n<hr>\n<p><br>也請看看 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-pack/\">Allure</a>，你可能會喜歡！如果你想收到材質包進度的更新通知、提供建議或回報任何錯誤，歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器，點擊<a href=\"https://discord.gg/C9Q6XFG8T8\">這裡</a>！</p>\n<br><br><hr>\n<h1>其他專案！</h1>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-pack\"><img alt=\"Allure 3D 植物\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab67244910ef4ab4fca79d7e98f4f7afbe9a75ec.webp\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-emoji-pack\"><img alt=\"Allure 表情符號包\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/62de9de72ccd55e8a14fd4b637eb9c54dd0fb888.png\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-dark-theme-gui\"><img alt=\"Allure 深色主題 GUI\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f8deee765f891b6ca092c2ae5c120c8ea01c9007.webp\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/allure-fresh-animations-support\"><img alt=\"Allure Fresh Animations 支援\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a4b12553ad59462994b06b9f7124fd36c9a81138.webp\"></a>\n</center>",
